{"parse": {"title": "GM-06", "pageid": 93621, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/GM-05\" title=\"GM-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">GM-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/GM-07\" title=\"GM-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">GM</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.8B.9F.E4.B8.94.E4.B8.8E.E6.81.90.E6.83.A7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"苟且与恐惧\">苟且与恐惧</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 苟且与恐惧</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Living in Fear</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>比<span class=\"color-value\"></span>害<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怕<span class=\"color-value\"></span>更<span class=\"color-value\"></span>甚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>未<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>出国的前一天晚上，我一直想，到了那边，我就终于可以完全摆脱我的劫了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>这次我会白手起家，在洛杉矶开一间除灵事务所，过上与之前截然不同的体面生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>不用再躺旧报纸，不用再食半生不熟的东西，没有胡茬，还有发臭的汗衫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>我同那边当地的鬼魂治理协会取得了联系，他们一直很想要一名来自中国的除灵师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>但我忘了——当人老到一定程度，就会发现“鬼”只是所有恐惧的事物里，最微不足道的一个。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员托尼：</div><div>哈哈哈，你们不明白……这个中国佬刚来的时候，背包里只带了一些稀奇古怪的小玩具，就妄想一个人把那所阴宅清理干净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员托尼：</div><div>我举着探灵器，他还问我是在打电话吗，活像一个从洞里刚爬出来的原始人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他撇下啤酒杯，伸出双手表演猴子的样子，惹得酒客们哄堂大笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员托尼：</div><div>Chen，来，别害羞。把你的木头剑和铃铛拿出来，让他们瞧瞧你的把式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>角落里，埋着头格格不入的男人攥紧了拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员鲁特：</div><div>Chen，别理他，放轻松。托尼的脑子早就喝坏掉了，我们都知道你有自己的一套法子。只是你还需要点儿时间向我们验证它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员托尼：</div><div>法子？你是说学着那些走秀的模特，走起那个所谓的“七星禹步”，哈哈哈……别耍宝了，伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员托尼：</div><div>我们给他的时间也够多了，足足几年工夫了，他除了为我们找乐子的功夫有长进，还显了什么能耐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>……我先走了，明天见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人不约而同噤声了，在注视着他离开以后，转瞬——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又爆出了一阵笑声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员托尼：</div><div>说真的，鲁特……你爱发善心的习惯真是让我百看不厌，哈哈哈。我爱你那装作好人的样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员鲁特：</div><div>我是在说实话，托尼。我们好不容易有了个乡巴佬供我们取乐，你怎么能这样把他气走呢？况且有这家伙露脸，咱们在那些唐人街的地方就好办很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员鲁特：</div><div>你应该听说了，最近唐人街开张了一个除灵事务所，圣洛夫基金会已经同那个女孩接触过了，她得到了批准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员鲁特：</div><div>相比起来，Chen现在那些滑稽的除灵把戏完全抬不上台面，连那些唐人都不信这一套。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-625001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员托尼：</div><div>她叫什么名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-564810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">协会成员鲁特：</div><div>是个怪名字，叫作——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">泥鯭的士</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>——我站在门口，听到了所有的对话，但我知道我没得选，所以我走向了街区的出租屋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>讽刺的是，或许这是我成为除灵师的原因，比起“鬼”，我更害怕贫穷，也害怕疾病，害怕他们所有人的目光，害怕被审视，害怕被失望——害怕人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>我害怕自己如果离开协会，一切都会回归原点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>我站在分岔路口，我知道我只需拐个角就能到唐人街。那里有我熟悉的神秘学家与人类共融的世界。但我不会走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>只有往前，只有往前，后面不会有任何东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我感到有好多双眼在看我，天命就悬在我头顶，所以我没有回头，我一直跑，一直跑——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我知道她又追过来了，我的劫还没有过去，我还要继续逃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有逃才有出路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">别感到安全，别感到安全。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">不要耽于愉悦，那会让你麻痹，最终摔得粉身碎骨。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">惩罚很快会来的，你的劫还没有过去。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">它就在前面，一直在前面等你掉进去。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">别喘息。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">还不能喘息。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>啊啊啊啊啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那天午夜，我大汗淋漓地从噩梦中醒来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后，我做了决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我要亲手杀死李安安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嘟、嘟——嘟。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>喂，鲁特、托尼……我是Chen，有空没？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-565301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">陈半仙：</div><div>关于唐人街，我有办法帮你们，明日下午三时，来灯塔找我。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "GM-06"}}